सपनों का घर (रात) — lyric film

Song (audio and lyrics): the user's own track, made with Suno; unchanged except loudness normalisation to -14 LUFS.
Typeface: Tiro Devanagari Hindi (Regular, Italic) by Tiro Typeworks — SIL Open Font License 1.1, fonts/OFL.txt. Source: github.com/google/fonts
Lyric timings: faster-whisper (MIT) with the Whisper "medium" model (MIT); hand-corrected against the lyrics.
Render and mastering tools: Lemo-Opuscar core tools; Playwright/Chromium (Apache-2.0); FFmpeg (LGPL/GPL).
All scenery, characters and animation are drawn in code for this film (main.js).
